/E (Configurable Privileges for AI Features: Recognizing that every enterprise has its unique needs and security concerns, we've incorporated configurable privileges for AI functionalities. This allows organizational leaders to decide which users can leverage advanced AI features, be it Auto or the more sophisticated ML-driven analytics and visualizations. It provides businesses with the flexibility to balance innovation with security protocols. )
